import animation.dl

to get [the UI switch position of] {a pointer to UI layout:layout} [in] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set enabled to (the UI value for (layout's node) in (view's instance))'s number != 0
    set destination to 1.0 if enabled, else 0.0
    if (layout's painted = false) or view's instance's reduced motion:
        set layout's transition to destination
    else:
        set layout's transition to UI value (layout's transition) approaching destination at speed 18.0 in view
    set layout's painted to true
    return layout's transition
